==Description==
The '''Rainy Nametag''' is a {{Color|Legendary}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|5,000}}.

The '''Rainy Nametag''' has blue text with a black outline. Behind the nametag, dark grey and black rain clouds appear, which create rain drops that fall on your avatar.

